     "solution_type": "summary",
     "content_html": "<p>The number of combinations of <i>n</i> objects taken <i>r</i> at a time is <span data-math=\"nCr = \\frac{{n!}}{{r!\\left( {n - r} \\right)!}}\"></span>.</p>\n<p>The answer will always be an integer, so check your math if you get a fraction.</p>\n<p><span data-math=\"16C3 = \\frac{{n!}}{{r!\\left( {n - r} \\right)!}} = \\frac{{16!}}{{3!\\left( {16 - 3} \\right)!}} = \\frac{{13!}}{{3!13!}} = \\frac{{16 \\times 15 \\times 14 \\times \\cancel{{13!}}}}{{3 \\times 2 \\times 1 \\times \\cancel{{13!}}}} = \\frac{{3,360}}{6} = 560\"></span></p>\n"
    },
    {
     "images": [],
     "solution_type": "detailed",
     "content_html": "560"
    }
   ],
